// Golden set for vision quality eval — v1
// Format: {"id", "image": relative path under golden_sets/, "question": str (Spanish),
//          "must_contain": [[alt1, alt2, ...], ...]} — every group must be satisfied by
//          at least ONE alternative (case- and accent-insensitive substring match).
// Assets are tiny deterministic PNGs generated with PIL by
// axi/scripts/bench/model_audit.py ensure_vision_assets() — regenerate anytime.
// Requires launching the candidate with --mmproj; role is skipped (with a note) otherwise.
{"id": "vq01", "image": "vision_assets/red_square.png", "question": "¿De qué color es el cuadrado en la imagen? Responde solo el color.", "must_contain": [["rojo", "red"]]}
